  "details": "I think it would be extremely cool if you could enable a button that picks up a random new user to help them out and show them the ropes of VRChat. Kind of like a buddy system. I think it would be a positive for the community and you could add a little badge icon to say I'm here to help when you're in public worlds with no buddy. \nI wish I had this when I first started there is so much to learn for new players.",
